                                                                    "text": "Input: \n- A variable size list of candidates, ordered from closest to furthest (20x bigger than num neighbours).\n\nAlgorithm: \n- If cluster filter is all, just take the first N values and output.\n- If not, take the closest value (element 0) and check its label. If it satisfies the filter, collect and increment the \"collected elements\" counter. If the current list length is equal to the desired N, output list. If not, increment the lookup counter.\n- If the label is not the same as the filter, just increment the lookup counter (lookup next element)."
